e":"p_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n(3) 若从状态 1 到状态 2 过程中气体吸收热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 120 \\mathrm{~J}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 求外界对气体做的功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W"},{"type":"text","value":" 及气体内能变化 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2cef7992e3bee3f31c45216a206d506603f26adda577d927e26adba8f0600646.png","width":221,"height":266,"width_mm":25.818,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2504-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f3abd9e8eef6bd049b494e3e0870cb72512499b4dda54443b6b7f3ecb97e6b96.png","width":586,"height":375,"width_mm":68.848,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2504-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图\n乙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8 分）解析:(1)(2 分)状态 2 温度高，分子平均速率大，对应曲线 B；气体温度从 300K 至 400K 过程为等压变化，单位时间内单位面积气缸壁受到撞击力不变，但每次分子撞击力变大，故撞击次数减少。\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"mg + p_{0}S = p_{1}S"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1} = 1.05 \\times 10^{5} \\, Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n气体先做等压变化，由气体状态方程可知"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{SL_1}{T_1} = \\frac{SL_2}{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可知"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{T} = 450\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n后气体做等容变化"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{p_1}{T} = \\frac{p_2}{T_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"p_2 = 1.12\\times 10^5\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -p_{1}S\\left(L_{2} - L_{1}\\right) = -21\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分）\n由热力学第一定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q = 99 J"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jiyang-lianyi-2504-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jiyang-lianyi-2504","source_question_id":"jiyang-lianyi-2504-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5a2018b68a0edb776506a4cf715e54077d76218979a21621ab2d1fe19033557c"