type":"text","value":" 从轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 上滑下后进入圆弧轨道, 运动到与圆心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 等高的 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 点时对轨道的压力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"32 \\mathrm{~N}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。忽略空气阻力, 重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^{2}, \\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6, \\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a4e5b5675bf1a83c3db5540045ad1d5ce4eb34b05a049f49b0d9a3f206ff4f60.png","width":1186,"height":378,"width_mm":139.375,"row_group":"jiyang-lianyi-2504-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16题图\n(1) 求 h 的大小;\n(2) 求 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 组合体刚到达 F 点时的速度大小；\n(3) 求最终 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 M 最右端之间的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta L"},{"type":"text","value":" 。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"运动到 C 点时，根据牛顿第二定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N} = \\frac{m_{1}v_{c}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{c} = 2\\sqrt{10}m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"从 A 到 C 的运动过程，根据动能定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}g(h-R)=\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{C}^{2}-0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n联立代入数据解得 h=2.25m （1 分）\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"从"},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"的运动过程，根据动能定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}gh = \\frac{1}{2} m_{1}v_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B} = 3\\sqrt{5} m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text